&CONTROL OFF NOMSG
*
************************************************************
*   PASRUN EXEC to run Pascal programs (TEXT files)
*   OPP - 08.2023
************************************************************
*
&IF .&1 EQ .? &GOTO -HELP
&IF .&1 EQ . &GOTO -NOFILE
&ANZ = &INDEX
*-----------------------------------------------------------
STATE &1 TEXT *
&IF &RETCODE EQ 0 &GOTO -OK1
&TYPE FILE &1 TEXT NOT FOUND
&END
&EXIT &RETCODE
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-OK1
&IF &INDEX LE 1 &GOTO -OK2
&IF &2 EQ ( &GOTO -RUNTONLY
&IF &* NE ( &GOTO -MODONLY
&IF &3 EQ ( &GOTO -MOD1
&IF &4 EQ ( &GOTO -MOD2
&IF &5 EQ ( &GOTO -MOD3
&IF &6 EQ ( &GOTO -MOD4
&BEGTYPE
MORE THAN 4 SUBMODULES ARE NOT ALLOWED (AT THE MOMENT)
&END
&EXIT 99
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-RUNTONLY
&R1 = &3
&R2 = &4
&R3 = &5
&R4 = &6
&R5 = &7
&R6 = &8
&R7 = &9
&R8 = &10
&R9 = &11
&R10 = &12
&R11 = &13
&R12 = &14
&R13 = &15
&R14 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-MODONLY
&M1 = &2
&M2 = &3
&M3 = &4
&M4 = &5
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-MOD1
&M1 = &2
&R1 = &4
&R2 = &5
&R3 = &6
&R4 = &7
&R5 = &8
&R6 = &9
&R7 = &10
&R8 = &11
&R9 = &12
&R10 = &13
&R11 = &14
&R12 = &15
&R13 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-MOD2
&M1 = &2
&M2 = &3
&R1 = &5
&R2 = &6
&R3 = &7
&R4 = &8
&R5 = &9
&R6 = &10
&R7 = &11
&R8 = &12
&R9 = &13
&R10 = &14
&R11 = &15
&R12 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-MOD3
&M1 = &2
&M2 = &3
&M3 = &4
&R1 = &6
&R2 = &7
&R3 = &8
&R4 = &9
&R5 = &10
&R6 = &11
&R7 = &12
&R8 = &13
&R9 = &14
&R10 = &15
&R11 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-MOD4
&M1 = &2
&M2 = &3
&M3 = &4
&M4 = &5
&R1 = &7
&R2 = &8
&R3 = &9
&R4 = &10
&R5 = &11
&R6 = &12
&R7 = &13
&R8 = &14
&R9 = &15
&R10 = &16
&GOTO -OK2
*
************************************************************
* PASMATH NEEDED FOR MATH FUNCTIONS
* REPLACE PASMATH WITH NAME OF YOUR FORTRAN G LIBRARY
* THE NAMES OF THE NEEDED (STANDARD) PASCAL RUNTIME
* LIBRARIES ARE ADDED VIA &STACK, &READ ARGS ETC.
* MORE MAY FOLLOW.
************************************************************
*
-OK2
GLOBAL TXTLIB PASMATH
&L1 = PASMONN
&L2 = PASLIBX
&L3 = PASUTILS
&L4 = PASSNAPC
&O1 = ORIGIN
&O2 = 20700
&O3 = RESET
&O4 = $PASENT
&O5 = CLEAR
LOAD &L1 &L2 &L3 &L4 &M1 &M2 &M3 &M4 &1 ( &O1 &O2 &O3 &O4 &O5
&IF &RETCODE NE 0 &GOTO -NOLOAD
*-----------------------------------------------------------
GENMOD &1
&IF &RETCODE NE 0 &GOTO -NOMOD
*-----------------------------------------------------------
FILEDEF QRD DISK &1 DBGINFO (RECFM F
XRUNPARM &1 &R1 &R2 &R3 &R4 &R5 &R6 &R7 &R8 &R9 &R10 &R11 &R12 &R13 &R14
&RCODE = &RETCODE
ERASE &1 MODULE
&EXIT &RCODE
*
************************************************************
* ALL SORT OF ERROR MESSAGES
************************************************************
*
-NOFILE
&TYPE MISSING FILE NAME - 1ST PARAM.
&GOTO -HELP
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-NOLOAD
&TYPE ERROR &RETCODE ON LOAD COMMAND.
&EXIT &RETCODE
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-NOMOD
&TYPE ERROR &RETCODE ON GENMOD.
&EXIT &RETCODE
*-----------------------------------------------------------
-HELP
&BEGTYPE

USE THIS EXEC TO RUN A STANFORD PASCAL PROGRAM.
SPECIFY THE FILE NAME OF THE TEXT FILE CONTAINING THE
TRANSLATED 370 CODE ON THE COMMAND LINE.
MORE OPTIONS:
SPECIFY MORE TEXT FILES CONTAINING SUBPROGRAMS
AND: SPECIFY RUNTIME PARAMETERS FOLLOWING A LEFT PARANTHESIS
E.G.: PASRUN MAIN SUB1 SUB2 SUB3 ( PARM1 PARM3 PARM3

&END
